{"synopsis":"Sebuah game virtual reality yang menelan dunia, God of Savior.\n\nDan game yang menjadi fondasinya—Deus Ex Machina: Ragnarok, yang biasa disebut Demrock.\n\nDi puncaknya berdiri Kaiser, ranker tak tertandingi yang memegang posisi #1 mutlak.\n\nDulu dipuja layaknya dewa, ia menghilang karena keadaan yang tak terhindarkan…\n\nKini, setelah 1 tahun 6 bulan. Dia telah kembali.\n\n“Apakah kamu ingin login?”","alternative_title":"The Return of the Unrivaled Genius Ranker, 역대급 천재 랭커의 귀환","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c8e8de7d-b3dc-4885-9aa4-c22803bbcbc3","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"b4a2ef89-8386-443a-be3b-43cc5b4c6282","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"eba5c00e-ca66-47e8-a287-52411abdfff2","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"3a14418a-bb6c-484f-9d9d-0f0d477fccc3","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"8c62f98b-0e19-4ced-a6c8-61bfdeb499f3","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"1d2be982-1a2c-4da4-9762-7bbc3f1a780f","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"5228fb26-2af5-4950-9878-ef922ee81dac","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id":"a0ad1a5b-98c7-4cd8-9f83-ddb5ccaf8147","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"182a3d6f-2ead-42be-b6a5-3ab234d4b41a","number":"27","chapter":"27","title":"","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05"},{"chapter_id":"da5a02c0-5a8b-44e9-aa7e-8bec35a92ce0","number":"26","chapter":"26","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"8813b480-c237-4dcc-8143-f0a627ba3272","number":"25","c